author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Add an isolated real-Git shared-prefix add/add regression distinct from independent identity collisions; Preserve both streams through authenticated settlement or recoverable actionable refusal; Keep the existing ambiguous-creation refusal and history-hash invariants; Make conflict status and health/reconciliation guidance explicit for operator resolution
definition_of_ready: "Report, open settlement lineage and completed ancestry guard were read; require an isolated real-Git reproduction and explicit preservation policy before implementation"
goal: project management = context management
objective: Keep multi-agent context lossless or explicitly recoverable at empty-Git-base merge boundaries
value: Agents can resolve structured conflicts without treating marker-free content as a proven lossless merge
